{"seq":3,"slug":"vector-lexical-hybrid-clir","title":"向量+词法混合跨语言检索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-language-retrieval/multilingual-embeddings/vector-lexical-hybrid-clir","wordCount":2276,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"向量-词法混合跨语言检索\">向量+词法混合跨语言检索</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>纯向量在电商检索上会漏两类东西：<strong>精确标识</strong>与<strong>稀有词项</strong>。用户搜 <code>SKU-8847291</code>、<code>Anker A3040</code>、<code>USB-C to Lightning 2m</code>，向量模型会把语义相近的其它型号、其它线缆排上来——对用户而言这不是「相似推荐」而是错误结果。反过来，纯词法在跨语言上几乎完全失效：它对 <code>écouteurs</code> 和 <code>earbuds</code> 之间没有任何桥。</p>\n<p>混合检索（hybrid retrieval）因此成为跨语言检索的默认生产形态：向量负责跨语言的语义匹配，词法负责精确与稀有匹配，两路结果融合后再排序。难点不在「两路都跑」，而在<strong>跨语言条件下词法这一路怎么获得目标语言的词项</strong>——这正是本章要拆解的核心问题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;原语言查询&lt;br/&gt;écouteurs sans fil&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;向量路&lt;br/&gt;多语言编码器&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C{&quot;词法路: 词项从哪来&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;方案 A: 翻译查询&quot;| D[&quot;译文&lt;br/&gt;wireless earbuds&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;方案 B: 原文音译/词典&quot;| E[&quot;écouteurs→earbuds&lt;br/&gt;词典直连&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;BM25 / 倒排&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    B --&gt; G[&quot;向量检索 top-k&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; H[&quot;词法 top-k&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; I[&quot;融合&lt;br/&gt;RRF / 加权归一&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J[&quot;跨语言重排&lt;br/&gt;含语言偏好特征&quot;]&#10;    J --&gt; K[&quot;结果&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"原语言查询&lt;br/&gt;écouteurs sans fil\"] --&gt; B[\"向量路&lt;br/&gt;多语言编码器\"]\n    A --&gt; C{\"词法路: 词项从哪来\"}\n    C --&gt;|\"方案 A: 翻译查询\"| D[\"译文&lt;br/&gt;wireless earbuds\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"方案 B: 原文音译/词典\"| E[\"écouteurs→earbuds&lt;br/&gt;词典直连\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"BM25 / 倒排\"]\n    E --&gt; F\n    B --&gt; G[\"向量检索 top-k\"]\n    F --&gt; H[\"词法 top-k\"]\n    G --&gt; I[\"融合&lt;br/&gt;RRF / 加权归一\"]\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J[\"跨语言重排&lt;br/&gt;含语言偏好特征\"]\n    J --&gt; K[\"结果\"]</pre><p>图中 <code>C</code> 的分叉是跨语言混合检索的关键决策点，两条方案各有明确适用面，下面分别展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"词法路的三条取词途径\">词法路的三条取词途径</h2><p><strong>途径一：翻译查询后走词法（translate-then-lexical）。</strong> 复用第一章的查询翻译，把译文送进倒排索引。这是最容易落地的，因为它把已有的 QT 实现直接变成混合检索的一路。它的行为特征是：<strong>词法路的精度完全等于翻译质量</strong>，翻译对了这路就是精确匹配，翻错了这路要么空要么错。因此它适合翻译质量高的语言对（高资源、术语词典覆盖良好）。</p>\n<p><strong>途径二：词典直连与音译（dictionary-and-transliteration）。</strong> 不依赖 MT，用双语词典把查询词逐词映射到目标语言，映射不上的词保留原文并做音译/罗马化后匹配。这条路的覆盖率低（一般 40%–70% 的查询词能被词典命中）但<strong>零漂移</strong>——词对词映射不会引入句级的语义错误。它特别适合：品牌与型号密集的查询、翻译质量差的低资源语言对、以及需要可解释性的场景（你能列出命中了哪些词对）。</p>\n<p><strong>途径三：多语言词项索引（multilingual term index）。</strong> 在文档侧而不是查询侧做文章：索引里为每份文档额外存储它的<strong>多语言词项特征</strong>——包括品牌名的多语言写法、型号的罗马化形式、以及从文档译文里抽取的关键词项。查询时原文直接匹配这些特征。这条路的成本在离线（要为每份文档生成多语言词项），好处是在线路径零翻译、零词典查询，时延与单语言检索相同。</p>\n<p>三条途径不必互斥，实践中常同时启用，用查询特征路由（品牌密集走途径二、长自然语言查询走途径一）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>途径</th>\n<th>在线成本</th>\n<th>覆盖率</th>\n<th>漂移风险</th>\n<th>最适合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>翻译后词法</td>\n<td>一次翻译调用</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高（句级错误直接传导）</td>\n<td>高资源语言对、翻译质量稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>词典 + 音译</td>\n<td>一次查表（可本地）</td>\n<td>中（40%–70% 词覆盖）</td>\n<td>低（词级映射）</td>\n<td>品牌型号密集、低资源语言对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多语言词项索引</td>\n<td>零</td>\n<td>取决于离线生成质量</td>\n<td>低但固化</td>\n<td>时延敏感、文档量可控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"融合-rrf-为什么是默认选择\">融合：RRF 为什么是默认选择</h2><p>两路结果的分数<strong>不可直接比较</strong>——BM25 分数是无界正数、依赖文档长度与词频统计，余弦相似度在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[-1, 1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 之间。直接加权相加需要做分数归一化，而归一化本身引入参数（最小值/最大值怎么取、按查询归一还是全局归一），在跨语言场景里更难调，因为不同语言对的分数分布不同。</p>\n<p>倒数排名融合（Reciprocal Rank Fusion, RRF）绕开了这个问题，只用排名：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{RRF}(d) = \\sum_{r \\in R} \\frac{1}{k + \\mathrm{rank}_r(d)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">RRF</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6431em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">rank</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 是各路检索器、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是平滑常数（常用 60）。它的优点是<strong>无需归一化、无需调权重</strong>，对分数分布差异天然鲁棒——正好匹配跨语言场景里各路分数分布差异大的特点。缺点是丢弃了分数信息：一个相似度 0.95 的向量结果与一个 0.55 的结果在 RRF 里只差一个名次。</p>\n<p>需要保留分数信息时，用<strong>加权归一融合</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>s</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mtext>vec</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>s</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mtext>lex</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{score}(d) = \\alpha \\cdot \\tilde{s}_{\\text{vec}}(d) + (1-\\alpha) \\cdot \\tilde{s}_{\\text{lex}}(d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">vec</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lex</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>s</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是按查询做 min-max 归一化后的分数。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 应当<strong>按语言对设置</strong>而不是全局一个值：翻译质量高的语言对，词法路可信度高，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 可以小（如 0.5）；翻译质量差的，词法路不可靠，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 应当大（如 0.8）。这个语言对相关的权重是跨语言混合检索区别于单语言混合检索的最大工程差异。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;查询 + 语言对识别&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;该语言对词法路是否可信&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;高资源/词典覆盖好&quot;| C[&quot;alpha = 0.5&lt;br/&gt;词法权重高&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;低资源/翻译质量差&quot;| D[&quot;alpha = 0.8&lt;br/&gt;向量为主&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;未知/新语言对&quot;| E[&quot;alpha = 0.7&lt;br/&gt;保守偏向向量&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;融合&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;按语言对记录 alpha&lt;br/&gt;供离线调优&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"查询 + 语言对识别\"] --&gt; B{\"该语言对词法路是否可信\"}\n    B --&gt;|\"高资源/词典覆盖好\"| C[\"alpha = 0.5&lt;br/&gt;词法权重高\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"低资源/翻译质量差\"| D[\"alpha = 0.8&lt;br/&gt;向量为主\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"未知/新语言对\"| E[\"alpha = 0.7&lt;br/&gt;保守偏向向量\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"融合\"]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[\"按语言对记录 alpha&lt;br/&gt;供离线调优\"]</pre><h2 id=\"向量与词法的互补性验证\">向量与词法的互补性验证</h2><p>「两路都跑」不等于「两路互补」。上线前应当验证互补性，否则可能白付一份计算成本。做法是看<strong>查询级的两路命中差异</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>only-vec</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{only-vec}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">only-vec</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 只有向量路召回到正例的查询集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>only-lex</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{only-lex}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">only-lex</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 只有词法路召回到正例的查询集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>both</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{both}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">both</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 两路都命中。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>only-lex</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|Q_{\\text{only-lex}}|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">only-lex</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 接近零，说明词法路在跨语言上毫无贡献，它在做的事向量已经做了——考虑关掉它省成本。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>only-vec</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|Q_{\\text{only-vec}}|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">only-vec</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 很小而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>only-lex</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|Q_{\\text{only-lex}}|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">only-lex</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 很大，说明向量模型在该语言对上对齐很差，先回去做 <a href=\"embedding-alignment\">跨语言对齐与领域微调</a>，而不是加大词法权重。</li>\n<li>理想形态是两者都显著非零，说明互补成立。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>按查询类型再切一层会更有行动力：把查询分成「含型号/编码」「含品牌名」「纯自然语言」「含数字规格」四类，分别看两类查询的互补结构。经验上型号类查询的词法路贡献占绝对主导，纯自然语言查询则由向量路主导。这个结论直接指导路由——对型号类查询可以只跑词法路（省一次向量检索），对自然语言查询可以降低词法权重。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨语言场景特有的三个坑\">跨语言场景特有的三个坑</h2><p><strong>坑一：语言识别错误导致的错误路由。</strong> 用户搜 <code>batterie externe</code> 但被识别成意大利语，词典路由到错的词表，词法路全空。兜底是当语言识别置信度低于阈值时<strong>同时启用多语言词法</strong>（用原文匹配所有语言的词项索引），或直接只走向量路。</p>\n<p><strong>坑二：混合了不同语言的查询。</strong> 真实查询经常混语言：<code>iphone 15 ケース</code>（英语 + 日语）、<code>airpods 保护套</code>。这类查询对「翻译后再词法」很不友好——MT 会把整句当成一种语言处理。处理方式是<strong>按脚本/语言分段</strong>：用 Unicode 脚本检测切出不同语言的片段，各片段独立走词法路，向量路则用整句（多语言模型对混合语言有一定鲁棒性，但效果会下降）。</p>\n<p><strong>坑三：向量与词法对同一文档给出矛盾信号。</strong> 某个文档词法分极高（标题完整包含译文）但向量相似度很低。这通常意味着<strong>译文与原文语义偏离</strong>——文档的译文在字面上匹配了查询译文，但原文讲的是别的东西。这是 DT 路线特有的风险（译文被索引、原文没被校验）。缓解手段是把「译文-原文一致性」作为一个特征：离线计算每份译文的回译一致度，低一致度的译文在词法路降权。</p>\n<p>这三个坑有一个共同的处理原则：<strong>当一路的信号来源本身可疑时，先怀疑数据的正确性，再调融合权重</strong>。调权重只能优化「如何组合」，无法修正「输入是错的」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>纯向量漏精确标识，纯词法漏跨语言语义，混合是生产的默认形态。</li>\n<li>词法路的词项有三条来源：翻译后词法（复用 QT，漂移风险高）、词典与音译直连（覆盖率中但零漂移）、多语言词项索引（在线零成本，离线投入大）。</li>\n<li>融合首选 RRF（无需归一化、对分数分布差异鲁棒）；用加权归一融合时，权重必须按语言对设置，这是跨语言混合与单语言混合的最大差异。</li>\n<li>上线前必须验证互补性：按查询类型切分，看两路各自的独占命中量；没有互补就砍掉一路省成本。</li>\n<li>三个跨语言特有的坑：语言识别错误、混语言查询（按脚本分段）、译文与原文语义矛盾（用回译一致度降权）。</li>\n<li>通用原则：先怀疑数据正确性，再调融合权重。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一步：词法路依赖译文或词典，因此翻译质量直接决定混合检索的上限，读 <a href=\"../translation-quality/mt-errors-recall\">MT 错误（漏译/术语错）对召回的影响</a>；如何量化混合结构的收益，见 <a href=\"../clir-evaluation/per-language-pair-metrics\">按语言对分别评估召回</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"向量+词法混合跨语言检索","id":"向量-词法混合跨语言检索"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"词法路的三条取词途径","id":"词法路的三条取词途径"},{"level":2,"text":"融合：RRF 为什么是默认选择","id":"融合-rrf-为什么是默认选择"},{"level":2,"text":"向量与词法的互补性验证","id":"向量与词法的互补性验证"},{"level":2,"text":"跨语言场景特有的三个坑","id":"跨语言场景特有的三个坑"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"跨语言对齐与领域微调","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-language-retrieval/multilingual-embeddings/embedding-alignment"},"next":{"title":"MT 错误（漏译/术语错）对召回的影响","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-language-retrieval/translation-quality/mt-errors-recall"}}